  "verificationScope": "# Actual original Koszul internal-Hom top cohomology and geometric restriction\n\nLet X be any original scheme,N any original module sheaf and K any original\nchain complex. Construct the actual additive contravariant internal-Hom\nfunctor and actual original Hom cochain complex.\nLet R be any original commutative ring,N ANY original R-module,\nr=n+1>=1,H=(H_1,...,H_r),I=(H),K_j=exterior^j R^r,and i:Spec(R/I)->Spec R.\nThen construct an actual whole-complex iso between tilde of SAME native\nHom_R(K,N) and actual internal Hom of SAME tilde K into SAME tilde N.\nAll original differential compatibility squares are PROVED.\nCompute ACTUAL native top homology via the actual original restriction,\nPROVED kernel/image,PROVED epi,PROVED outgoing-zero,and native categorical\nCokernelCofork/HomologyData APIs. The actual class of L maps to L(v_r)modIN.\nMap actual homology data using PROVED tilde exactness and the SAME actual\nwhole-complex iso. Then construct an ACTUAL top COHOMOLOGY iso\nH^r(internalHom(tilde K,tilde N)) ~= ACTUAL i_*i^*tilde N.\nUnder this SAME iso,the ACTUAL original cycle class map equals SAME actual\ngeometric Koszul restriction. That restriction was already proved to equal\noriginal ordered-top evaluation followed by the ACTUAL geometric unit.\nNo SOURCE exactness,FP/free/flat/invertibility/CM of N,Noetherianity,field,\ndesired isomorphism/exactness/epi/cokernel/homology/compatibility certificate\nis a premise. Exterior source FP is proved from the original ordered basis.\nOnly the COMPLEX ChainComplex.linearYonedaObj is reused from the legacy\nExt source file;legacy Ext is NOT substituted for actual derived module Ext.\n\nLet X be any original scheme,N any original module sheaf;construct ACTUAL contravariant additive internal-Hom functor and ACTUAL cochain complex from SAME original chain complex. Let R be any original commutative ring,N ANY original R-module,r=n+1>=1,H:Fin r->R,I=(H),and K the SAME original Koszul chain complex with SAME original ordered basis,differentials and cut i:Spec(R/I)->Spec R. Reuse ONLY native ChainComplex.linearYonedaObj COMPLEX and ModuleCat.homLinearEquiv,not legacy Ext in its source file. Construct ACTUAL tilde/native-Hom/internal-Hom ISO OF WHOLE COCHAIN COMPLEXES and PROVE all original differential squares. Compute ACTUAL native top HOMOLOGY by PROVED original restriction/exactness/epi/outgoing-zero and existing CokernelCofork/HomologyData APIs. PROVE actual original cycle class maps to original L(v_r)modIN. Transfer mapped homology data through PROVED tilde exactness and SAME whole-complex iso. Construct ACTUAL top COHOMOLOGY iso H^r(internalHom(tilde K,tilde N))~=ACTUAL i_*i^*tilde N. PROVE original actual cycle/class morphism equals SAME geometric Koszul restriction,already PROVED as ordered-top evaluation followed by ACTUAL geometric unit. NO source exactness,FP/free/flat/invertibility/CM of N,Noetherianity,field or desired comparison/Hom/functor/complex/exactness/cokernel/homology/map-square certificate is assumed. Original exterior source FP derived from basis. This is actual COHOMOLOGY of the actual internal-Hom COMPLEX;derived SHEAF Ext comparison remains OPEN. GLOBAL original frames/line-bundle twists/epsilon/connecting and Cech-to-derived SHEAF/proper-duality/fixed original m sections remain OPEN. Normalized theta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180. All resource caps/oldholds unchanged.\n\nOPEN: Identify actual internal-Hom complex with derived SHEAF Ext on SAME original Koszul resolution;support finite of lower cohomology must be proved,not replaced by a target CM/freeness assumption.\nGlue ORIGINAL global line-bundle frames/twists and SAME original global epsilon/connecting.\nActual Cech-to-derived SHEAF/proper-duality and nonzero fixed original m sections.\nNormalized theta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180.\nThis actual COHOMOLOGY computation does NOT yet identify derived SHEAF Ext.\nGLOBAL original line-bundle frames/twists and GLOBAL epsilon/connecting,\nactual Cech-to-derived SHEAF/proper-duality and original fixed m sections\nremain separate OPEN obligations. Original4.1/4.2/main OPEN;normalized theta\nUNVERIFIED;checkpoint180. No whole-project checkpoint/remote Lean CI claim.\n\n7 root modules,512 physical source lines,35 exact declarations\n(18 proofs,17 definitions);69 closed\nmodules,62 byte-identical older frozen dependencies.\nAll35 full exact types manually read;only standard Lean axioms propext,\nClassical.choice and Quot.sound. One compiler,8GiB,2threads,CPU25%,20min;\nall older resource holds retained. Sources/staging/logs/packs on D drive.\nLean4.35.0-rc3;mathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
